Description=Generic CiA 301 communication objects only. Not the object dictionary of any particular device - assign it by hand to a device whose own EDS you do not have, to reach the objects every CANopen device is required or widely expected to carry. Reading an object this device does not implement answers with an SDO abort, which the bench shows.
